[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900100_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900100_02_0010","text":"制作人\n想好要什么了吗～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900100_02_0020","text":"嗯……\n还是想不出来"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900100_02_0030","text":"这样啊～\n慢慢来就好啦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900100_02_0040","text":"（……爱依也能乐在其中\n　我说想要也不会显得不自然的东西……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900100_02_0050","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900100_02_0060","text":"？\n制作人，肚子饿了吗～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900100_02_0070","text":"啊，确实有点──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900100_02_0080","text":"（──就是这个……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900100_02_0090","text":"？\n怎么了～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_31900100_02_0100","text":"……爱依，决定了哦\n想要的东西"}]
